                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty disappointingly forgettable in the grand scheme of the overall series. I think I actually missed playing this one as a kid, and my experience playing the following game wasn't impacted in the slightest. The character designs and HOPs themselves were nice, and I really liked the new characters introduced, but there were a lot of clumsy additions that made the game not quite as fun. I also found the presence of Rapunzel to be extremely clunky and jarring, even as a teaser for the next game.\n\nI wish there was a neutral review button, but since there isn't, I'd still say I lean positive on this one.",
